#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:4
msgid "class ImageIO -- ImageIO object"
msgstr "class ImageIO -- ImageIO 物件"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:6
msgid ""
"The :class:`ImageIO` class records and plays back streams of :class:`Image` "
"frames in OpenMV's native on-disk format. A single stream can hold "
"heterogeneous frames (different pixel formats / sizes) and records the "
"inter-frame interval for each one so playback re-creates the original frame "
"rate."
msgstr ""
":class:`ImageIO` 類別以 OpenMV 的原生磁碟格式錄製及播放 :class:`Image` "
"影格串流。單一串流可容納異質的影格（不同的像素格式／大小），並記錄每一影格之間的時間間隔，因此播放時能重現原始的影格率。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:12
msgid "There are two backing stores:"
msgstr "有兩種後端儲存方式："

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:14
msgid ""
"**File stream** -- frames are read from / appended to a file on the "
"filesystem. The file starts with a 16-byte magic header ``OMV IMG STR Vx.y``"
" followed by per-frame chunks. The current writer emits ``V2.0``; older "
"``V1.0`` and ``V1.1`` files are still readable."
msgstr ""
"**檔案串流** -- 影格從檔案系統上的檔案讀取／附加至該檔案。檔案開頭為 16 位元組的魔術標頭 ``OMV IMG STR Vx.y``\\ "
"，後接逐影格的資料區塊。目前的寫入器產生 ``V2.0``\\ ；較舊的 ``V1.0`` 與 ``V1.1`` 檔案仍可讀取。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Memory stream** -- frames are read from / written to a fixed-size RAM "
"buffer allocated at construction time. Useful for round-tripping frames "
"through filters that need a recording without touching the filesystem."
msgstr ""
"**記憶體串流** -- 影格從建構時配置的固定大小 RAM 緩衝區讀取／寫入。適用於讓影格在需要錄製的濾鏡間往返處理，而不必觸及檔案系統。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:26
msgid "Create an :class:`ImageIO` stream."
msgstr "建立一個 :class:`ImageIO` 串流。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:28
msgid ""
"If ``path`` is a **string**, a file stream is opened at that path. ``mode`` "
"must be one of:"
msgstr "若 ``path`` 為\\ **字串**\\ ，則在該路徑開啟檔案串流。\\ ``mode`` 必須為下列其中之一："

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:31
msgid ""
"``'r'`` -- open an existing file for reading. The magic header is validated "
"and the version (``V1.0`` / ``V1.1`` / ``V2.0``) is recorded for use by "
":meth:`version`."
msgstr ""
"``'r'`` -- 開啟既有檔案以供讀取。會驗證魔術標頭，並記錄版本（\\ ``V1.0`` / ``V1.1`` / ``V2.0``\\ ）供 "
":meth:`version` 使用。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:34
msgid ""
"``'w'`` -- truncate / create the file and write a fresh ``V2.0`` magic "
"header. Frames are appended on each :meth:`write`."
msgstr "``'w'`` -- 截斷／建立檔案並寫入全新的 ``V2.0`` 魔術標頭。每次呼叫 :meth:`write` 時會附加影格。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:37
msgid ""
"If ``path`` is a **3-tuple** ``(w, h, pixformat)``, a memory stream is "
"allocated. ``mode`` is then the integer **number of frame slots** to pre-"
"allocate. The buffer is sized for ``count`` frames of ``(w, h, pixformat)`` "
"and is **not allowed to grow** after creation. ``pixformat`` is one of "
"`image.BINARY`, `image.GRAYSCALE`, `image.RGB565`, `image.BAYER`, "
"`image.YUV422`, `image.JPEG`, or `image.PNG`. For the compressed formats "
"(`image.JPEG`, `image.PNG`) the per-slot size is estimated at 2 bpp; frames "
"larger than the estimate raise ``ValueError`` at :meth:`write` time."
msgstr ""
"若 ``path`` 為\\ **3元組** ``(w, h, pixformat)``\\ ，則配置記憶體串流。此時 ``mode`` "
"為要預先配置的\\ **影格槽數量**\\ 整數。緩衝區大小依 ``count`` 個 ``(w, h, pixformat)`` 影格計算，建立後\\"
" **不允許增長**\\ 。\\ ``pixformat`` 為 `image.BINARY`\\ 、\\ `image.GRAYSCALE`\\ "
"、\\ `image.RGB565`\\ 、\\ `image.BAYER`\\ 、\\ `image.YUV422`\\ 、\\ "
"`image.JPEG` 或 `image.PNG` 其中之一。對於壓縮格式（\\ `image.JPEG`\\ 、\\ `image.PNG`\\ "
"），每個槽的大小以 2 bpp 估算；超過估算值的影格會在 :meth:`write` 時引發 ``ValueError``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:48
msgid "Inspection"
msgstr "檢視"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:52
msgid ""
"Return the stream backing store: :data:`FILE_STREAM` for a file stream, "
":data:`MEMORY_STREAM` for a memory stream."
msgstr "回傳串流的後端儲存方式：檔案串流為 :data:`FILE_STREAM`\\ ，記憶體串流為 :data:`MEMORY_STREAM`\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:57
msgid ""
"Return ``True`` if :meth:`close` has been called on this object. Once closed"
" the stream raises ``OSError(\"Stream closed\")`` on any further "
"read/write/seek."
msgstr ""
"若此物件已呼叫過 :meth:`close`\\ ，則回傳 ``True``\\ 。一旦關閉，串流在任何後續的讀取／寫入／搜尋時都會引發 "
"``OSError(\"Stream closed\")``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:63
msgid ""
"Return the number of frames currently stored in the stream. For file streams"
" this grows as :meth:`write` appends frames; for memory streams this is "
"fixed at construction time."
msgstr ""
"回傳目前串流中儲存的影格數量。對檔案串流而言，此值會隨著 :meth:`write` 附加影格而增長；對記憶體串流而言，此值在建構時即已固定。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:69
msgid ""
"Return the current frame index. Incremented by :meth:`read` and "
":meth:`write`, reset by :meth:`seek`."
msgstr "回傳目前的影格索引。由 :meth:`read` 與 :meth:`write` 遞增，並由 :meth:`seek` 重設。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:74
msgid ""
"Return the on-disk format version for file streams (``10`` for ``V1.0``, "
"``11`` for ``V1.1``, ``20`` for ``V2.0``). Returns ``None`` for memory "
"streams."
msgstr ""
"回傳檔案串流的磁碟格式版本（\\ ``V1.0`` 為 ``10``\\ 、\\ ``V1.1`` 為 ``11``\\ 、\\ ``V2.0`` 為 "
"``20``\\ ）。對記憶體串流則回傳 ``None``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:80
msgid ""
"Return the per-slot pixel buffer size in bytes for memory streams (the slot "
"size minus the internal :class:`Image` bookkeeping header). Returns ``None``"
" for file streams. Use this together with :meth:`count` to check whether a "
"particular frame size will fit."
msgstr ""
"回傳記憶體串流每個槽的像素緩衝區大小（位元組）（即槽大小減去內部 :class:`Image` 記帳標頭）。對檔案串流則回傳 ``None``\\ "
"。可搭配 :meth:`count` 使用，以檢查特定影格大小是否能容納。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:88
msgid ""
"Return the total bytes consumed by the stream -- the file size on disk for "
"file streams, or the full RAM-buffer size (``count * per_slot_size`` "
"including the per-slot header) for memory streams."
msgstr ""
"回傳串流佔用的總位元組數 -- 檔案串流為磁碟上的檔案大小，記憶體串流則為完整的 RAM 緩衝區大小（\\ ``count * "
"per_slot_size``\\ ，含每個槽的標頭）。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:94
msgid "I/O"
msgstr "I/O"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:98
msgid ""
"Append (file stream) or store-at-offset (memory stream) ``img`` and advance "
":meth:`offset` by one."
msgstr "附加（檔案串流）或在偏移位置儲存（記憶體串流）\\ ``img``\\ ，並將 :meth:`offset` 前進一格。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:101
msgid ""
"For file streams the file grows as frames are appended. Writing at a non-end"
" offset truncates the rest of the file so the count can shrink."
msgstr "對檔案串流而言，檔案會隨著影格附加而增長。在非結尾偏移處寫入會截斷檔案的其餘部分，因此影格數量可能會縮減。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:105
msgid ""
"For memory streams the frame is written into the current slot; writing past "
"the last slot raises ``EOFError(\"End of stream\")`` and writing a frame "
"larger than :meth:`buffer_size` raises ``ValueError(\"Invalid frame "
"size\")``."
msgstr ""
"對記憶體串流而言，影格會寫入目前的槽；寫入超過最後一個槽會引發 ``EOFError(\"End of stream\")``\\ ，而寫入大於 "
":meth:`buffer_size` 的影格會引發 ``ValueError(\"Invalid frame size\")``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:110
#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:144
#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:151
msgid "Returns ``self`` so calls can be chained."
msgstr "回傳 ``self``\\ ，因此呼叫可串接。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:114
msgid ""
"Read the frame at the current :meth:`offset`, advance the offset, and return"
" the new :class:`Image`. Mirrors the playback half of :meth:`write`."
msgstr ""
"讀取目前 :meth:`offset` 處的影格、前進偏移，並回傳新的 :class:`Image`\\ 。對應於 :meth:`write` "
"的播放部分。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:118
msgid ""
"``copy_to_fb`` -- when ``True`` (default) the decoded frame is placed in the"
" camera frame buffer (the same place a `csi.CSI.snapshot()` lands), so the "
"returned :class:`Image` is drawable through the IDE preview. When ``False`` "
"the frame is allocated on the MicroPython heap instead."
msgstr ""
"``copy_to_fb`` -- 當為 ``True``\\ （預設值）時，解碼後的影格會放入相機影格緩衝區（與 "
"`csi.CSI.snapshot()` 影像落腳的位置相同），因此回傳的 :class:`Image` 可透過 IDE 預覽繪製。當為 "
"``False`` 時，影格改為配置在 MicroPython 堆積上。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:124
msgid ""
"``loop`` (file streams only) -- when ``True`` (default) reading past the "
"last frame seeks back to the first frame and continues. When ``False`` the "
"call returns ``None`` once the end of the file is reached."
msgstr ""
"``loop``\\ （僅限檔案串流）-- 當為 ``True``\\ （預設值）時，讀取超過最後一個影格會搜尋回第一個影格並繼續。當為 "
"``False`` 時，一旦到達檔案結尾，呼叫會回傳 ``None``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:129
msgid ""
"``pause`` -- when ``True`` (default) the call blocks until the originally-"
"recorded inter-frame interval has elapsed, so playback runs at the "
"recording's native frame rate. Set to ``False`` for as-fast-as-possible "
"playback."
msgstr ""
"``pause`` -- 當為 ``True``\\ （預設值）時，呼叫會封鎖直到原始錄製的影格間隔時間流逝為止，因此播放會以錄製的原生影格率執行。設為"
" ``False`` 可進行盡可能快速的播放。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:136
msgid ""
"Move :meth:`offset` to frame ``offset``. ``offset`` must be non-negative; "
"memory-stream offsets must also be less than :meth:`count`."
msgstr ""
"將 :meth:`offset` 移至影格 ``offset``\\ 。\\ ``offset`` 必須為非負數；記憶體串流的偏移還必須小於 "
":meth:`count`\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:140
msgid ""
"File-stream seeks walk the file frame-by-frame from the start since frame "
"chunks are variable-sized -- expect O(offset) time for large jumps."
msgstr "由於影格區塊大小不固定，檔案串流的搜尋會從頭逐一影格走訪檔案 -- 大幅跳躍時預期為 O(offset) 時間。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:148
msgid ""
"Flush pending writes to disk for file streams (calls the underlying file-"
"system ``sync``). No-op for memory streams."
msgstr "對檔案串流而言，將待寫入的資料清空（flush）至磁碟（呼叫底層檔案系統的 ``sync``\\ ）。對記憶體串流則無作用。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:155
msgid ""
"Close the stream. Releases the memory buffer (memory streams) or closes the "
"file (file streams). After ``close()`` the :class:`ImageIO` object cannot be"
" reused; subsequent operations raise ``OSError(\"Stream closed\")``. Calling"
" ``close()`` twice is a no-op."
msgstr ""
"關閉串流。釋放記憶體緩衝區（記憶體串流）或關閉檔案（檔案串流）。在 ``close()`` 之後，\\ :class:`ImageIO` "
"物件無法再使用；後續操作會引發 ``OSError(\"Stream closed\")``\\ 。呼叫 ``close()`` 兩次則無作用。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:161
msgid ""
"An :class:`ImageIO` is also closed automatically when it is garbage-"
"collected (it registers a finaliser at construction)."
msgstr ":class:`ImageIO` 在被垃圾回收時也會自動關閉（它在建構時註冊了一個終結器）。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:165
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "常數"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:170
msgid "Value returned by :meth:`type` for file-backed streams."
msgstr ":meth:`type` 對於以檔案為後端的串流所回傳的值。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.ImageIO.rst:175
msgid "Value returned by :meth:`type` for in-memory streams."
msgstr ":meth:`type` 對於記憶體中串流所回傳的值。"
